 "section_summary": "This section comprises the concluding portion of a SCAP Civil Information and Education Section statistical report on educational institutions in Aomori Prefecture (pages 56-103) and the introductory pages of a companion report on Ehime Prefecture (pages 104-108). The Aomori section lists village, town, private, and ministerial elementary schools, youth schools, colleges, and kindergartens, detailing founding dates, enrollment, and teaching personnel as of April and November 1946, followed by a map of Northern Honshu. The Ehime section includes the report's cover, catalogue data, table of contents, and an introduction outlining the background, purpose, and administrative classifications of the nationwide educational survey.",
 "subfiles": [
  {
   "about": "A comprehensive roster and statistical survey of Japanese educational institutions in Aomori Prefecture as of April and November 1946, covering elementary schools, youth schools, private colleges, secondary schools, kindergartens, and institutions under other ministries.",
