   ],
   "start_page": 56,
   "summary": "This report provides detailed rosters and statistical data for educational institutions in Aomori Prefecture, listing school names, locations, founding dates, student enrollment by sex, and teacher counts for April and November 1946. It covers co-educational youth schools and elementary schools administered by towns and villages, municipal and private colleges, secondary schools, kindergartens, and miscellaneous schools, as well as vocational and youth schools operated under the Home Ministry, Ministry of Transportation, and Ministry of Communications. The report concludes with summary totals, footnotes on branch schools and part-time staff, and a regional reference map of Northern Honshu.",
   "title": "Roster of Japanese Educational Institutions: Aomori Prefecture",
   "to": ""
  },
