   "summary": "This section contains the cover, title sheet, table of contents, and introductory explanation for the SCAP special report on educational institutions in Ehime Prefecture. It details the purpose, methodology, terminology, and administrative jurisdictions governing Japanese schools prior to post-war educational reorganization.",
